# Google Search Console MCP Server Environment Variables

# Path to your Google Cloud service account credentials JSON file
# Option 1: Use GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS (standard Google convention)
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/your/credentials.json

# Option 2: Use GSC-specific variable
# GSC_CREDENTIALS_PATH=/path/to/your/credentials.json

# The credentials file should be a service account JSON with:
# - Search Console API access enabled
# - Appropriate permissions for your GSC properties
